    {
      "principle": "The expression 'Wife' used in Section 125 of the Code should be interpreted to mean only a legally wedded wife.",
      "held": "The word 'Wife' is not defined in the code except indicating in the Explanation to Section 125 its inclusive character so as to cover a divorce, A woman cannot be a divorcee unless there was a marriage in the eye of law preceding that status.",
